      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's okay to feel this way, but please remember that your existence is not defined by your ability to speak or think. You are more than just the words you choose to say; you are the person who feels this fear and seeks connection. If you are struggling with thoughts of losing yourself, please reach out to a professional who can help you navigate these difficult feelings. You are not alone, and there is hope for you.",
